     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi folks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I’ve run into  a new error while using the openCR moving.fit function.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; PhiD_JSSAsecrD&lt;-openCR.fit(IA,mask=mask.clipped,type=&#39;JSSAsecrD&#39;,method=&quot;BFGS&quot;, ncores=4,model=list(phi~t,D~t))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">Error in hclust(dist(object), ...) : must have n &gt;= 2 objects to cluster<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">In addition: Warning message:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">In (function (..., deparse.level = 1)  :<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">  number of columns of result is not a multiple of vector length (arg 1)</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Does anyone know what I may have done wrong?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The read.capthist function says no errors but I do have a couple of warning messages. I haven’t run into this error before despite using this code several times now.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">IA&lt;-read.capthist(captfile=&quot;2012_2019_IA_SECR_capturedata.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                  trapfile = list(&quot;2012MAY_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2012OCT_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2013APR_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2013OCT_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2014MAY_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2014OCT_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2015_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2016_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2017_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2018_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2019MAY_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                                  &quot;2019AUG_IA_SECR_traplocs_BLinterferenceremoved.txt&quot;),<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                  detector = &quot;multi&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                  fmt=c(&quot;trapID&quot;,&quot;XY&quot;),<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">+ </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">                  covnames=list(&quot;Species&quot;,&quot;Sex&quot;))<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">No errors found :-)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">Warning messages:<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">1: In make.capthist(captures = capturelist[[i]], traps = trps, fmt = fmt,  :<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">  dropping repeat detections within occasions at exclusive detectors (traps)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">2: In verify.capthist(temp) :<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">  Levels of factor covariate(s) differ between sessions<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">intervals(IA)&lt;-c(5,6,6,7,5,6,12,12,12,12,3)/12<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">summary(IA)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Thanks,</span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Cheryl</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> 